Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:03.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Alex congratulations through to the semifinal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克丝 恭喜你闯进这里的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,The crazy Yes. round of applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声送给她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Come on.  The crazy thing is the last semi-final you made was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,有意思的是 你上一次打进半决赛也没多久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:19.48,EN,,0,0,0,,not that long ago in Berlin and you beat your same opponent the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:19.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在柏林 对手一样 比分也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,same score line. What I know it's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道 这太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:26.60,EN,,0,0,0,,What is it about playing Elina that brings out the best in you as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟斯维托丽娜打为什么总能激发出你最好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.00,EN,,0,0,0,,such a great player that you have to beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,她可是很难赢的强手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't think that it's specifically because of who I'm up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不觉得是因为对手是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:36.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I think uh I came in with a great mindset today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想是我今天带着很好的心态上场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I was playing really well and of course Elina hit some good
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得确实不错 当然斯维托丽娜也打出了一些好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:44.28,EN,,0,0,0,,shots. She was being aggressive, especially in that second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,她很有攻击性 尤其是第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm really happy that I was able to kind of keep my rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴自己保持住了节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What you are learning along the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一路你学到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:54.60,EN,,0,0,0,,This is really your first full year on tour after last year, but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:54.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年才是你真正意义上完整的一个巡回赛年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,what is it that you're learning about yourselves in these moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这些时刻 在这样的比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:01.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in these types of matches, in this atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这样的气氛下 你对自己有什么新的认识
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's so many things that I've learned about the tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于巡回赛 关于我自己 我学到了太多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,about myself, about kind of what it takes to sustain this level,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,包括要维持这个水平需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:13.24,EN,,0,0,0,,both physically and mentally, and just the effort you need to have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体上和心理上都是 还有你必须付出的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to, you know, hang with these top players and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能跟这些顶尖球员周旋并且站得住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:19.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's definitely a long process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这肯定是个漫长的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not I'm just at the beginning of that learning process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还只是在这个学习过程的开头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm really excited for what's ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我对接下来非常期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:33.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, I know your next opponent, Naomi Osaka, which is going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你下一个对手是大坂直美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:38.28,EN,,0,0,0,,an amazing match between the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们俩这场一定很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You're all very excited about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts about playing Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟大坂直美交手你怎么看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you've grown up also watching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想你也是看着她长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:48.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is of course such an accomplished player and I think she's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 她当然是非常有成就的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:53.80,EN,,0,0,0,,made waves on and off the tennis court uh for so many reasons and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我觉得她在球场内外都掀起过波澜 原因有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.48,EN,,0,0,0,,uh there's so much respect to her for that and you know I'm really
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点我非常尊敬她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:02:01.96,EN,,0,0,0,,excited. Um I haven't had much time to think about it but I will
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:02:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很期待 我还没什么时间去想这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,definitely think about it after I get off court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,但下场之后我一定会好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, I'm going to give you one more chance to thank all your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我再给你一次机会 感谢你所有的菲律宾球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Filipino fans. They're in the crowd here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们就在现场看台上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, whatever you want to say, the mic is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,想说什么都可以 话筒交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:24.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, through the semifinals, Alexandra Eala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 闯进半决赛的 伊埃拉
